      {
        "id": 240836,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-10-11T13:10:01.300Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sicba\">@Sicba</a>! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=10\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> Glad to have you here!</p>\n<p>Your best bet to get a response from the GTG folks is probably to send your question to the <a href=\"mailto:Contact@GreaterThanGames.com\">Contact@GreaterThanGames.com</a> email address. They monitor that more closely than the forums. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=10\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\"></p>\n<p>And even if they don’t go and/or don’t bring the promo packs, hopefully another vendor will have them. Good luck! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/crossed_fingers/2.png?v=10\" title=\":crossed_fingers:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":crossed_fingers:t2:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-10-11T13:12:25.013Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
