        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Welcome, @Sicba! :D Glad to have you here! \n\nYour best bet to get a response from the GTG folks is probably to send your question to the Contact@GreaterThanGames.com email address. They monitor that more closely than the forums. :blush: \n\nAnd even if they don't go and/or don't bring the promo packs, hopefully another vendor will have them. Good luck! :crossed_fingers:t2:",
