        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/eb8c5e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-10-11T14:24:56.925Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, thanks for helping.</p>\n<p>I’ve sent them an email a month ago, they told me that they don’t know whether they’ll go or not, probably not, but they’ll see for vendors and tell me where I can search for packs (partner vendors and similar)</p>\n<p>I’ve sent them a few mails asking if they know something more, they don’t respond at all anymore.</p>",
